          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Findutils package contains programs to find files. Programs are provided to search through all the files in a directory tree and to create, maintain, and search a database (often faster than the recursive find, but unreliable unless the database has been updated recently). Findutils also supplies the"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "xargs"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "program, which can be used to run a specified command on each file selected by a search."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
